OL,4,CMoD lacks emails for reservists      W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GThe Ministry of Defence (MoD) is     W5
OL,7,Gurging reservists to update their    W5
OL,8,Gcontact details, after it has        W5
OL,9,Gemerged it does not have email       W5
OL,10,Gaddresses for about half of them.    W5
OL,11,                                      W5
OL,12,GThe UK has an estimated 95,000       W5
OL,13,Gmembers in its strategic reserve     W5
OL,14,Gforce, which is made up of veterans  W5
OL,15,Gwho can be recalled in exceptional   W5
OL,16,Gcircumstances, but the MoD said it   W5
OL,17,Ghas only been able to send letters   W5
OL,18,Gto around 50,000.                    W5
OL,19,                                      W5
